.TH "TLDR" "1" "Oct 26, 2026" "" "tldr"
.SH NAME
tldr \- tldr 3.4.4
.sp
Python command\-line client for tldr\-pages.

.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
usage: tldr [options] command...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH POSITIONAL ARGUMENTS
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B command
page to show, e.g. \fItar\fP or \fIgit checkout\fP
.UNINDENT
.SH NAMED ARGUMENTS
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
show program\(aqs version number and exit
.TP
.B \-p, \-\-platform
look on this platform first (linux, osx, windows, common, ...)
.TP
.B \-L, \-\-language
show pages only in this language
.TP
.B \-u, \-\-update, \-\-update_cache
update the offline cache (then show the page, if one is given)
.sp
Default: \fBFalse\fP
.TP
.B \-k, \-\-clear\-cache
delete the offline cache and exit
.sp
Default: \fBFalse\fP
.TP
.B \-l, \-\-list
list pages for the platform
.sp
Default: \fBFalse\fP
.TP
.B \-\-search
list pages whose name contains KEYWORD
.TP
.B \-s, \-\-source
read pages from this \fIpages\fP directory or URL instead of the cache
.TP
.B \-r, \-\-render
treat arguments as Markdown files to render
.sp
Default: \fBFalse\fP
.TP
.B \-m, \-\-markdown
print the raw Markdown of the page
.sp
Default: \fBFalse\fP
.TP
.B \-c, \-\-color
use colors even when not writing to a terminal
.sp
Default: \fBFalse\fP
.TP
.B \-S, \-\-short\-options
show short forms of options
.sp
Default: \fBFalse\fP
.TP
.B \-E, \-\-long\-options
show long forms of options
.sp
Default: \fBFalse\fP
.TP
.B \-\-print\-completion
Possible choices: bash, zsh, tcsh, fish, powershell
.sp
print shell completion script
